+- Results
+  - All required checks passed.
+  - `golangci-lint run ./...` passed with 0 issues.
+  - Focused HTTP and store tests passed.
+- Remaining risks or follow-ups
+  - This story is a read-only admin endpoint, so no audit event is emitted for the successful request; denied authorization continues through the existing auth/policy envelope path.
+  - `BE-0293` remains false and can expand contract coverage if the next iteration wants a separate test-story commit.
+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - Admin org-rooted read endpoints with `{org_id}` can use `organizationIDResolver` directly; support cross-tenant reads are then policy-driven and non-support callers are blocked before persistence.
+  - Readers for org-owned child collections should verify the parent organization first when an empty child list would otherwise hide an unknown target.
